data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_d5wVMhPh8lxKlXlD90qKBogK"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Captain of the courier ship Nightjar; she grew up in Vesper and belongs to the Lantern Guild. Her crew usually calls her Captain Ash.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - CAPTAINS â Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: b0cd3a42-d5b0-44dd-972d-da7d960aab40]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell.\n  - GREW_UP_IN â Vesper (city, port) [ID: 8e5eb323-f581-4ce1-8cf4-8bceb6847598]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - MEMBER_OF â Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: 8ada2504-3940-4fa0-9142-7b15d6e2c8fa]: The guild that maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners; it does not own the mines.\n\nBren Vale (person) [ID: 9a340887-524b-4387-9b69-d7e321c84b3a] [Aliases: Captain]: Captain of the fishing boat Petrel. People on the dock call him Captain. He is unrelated to Asha Pell and is not a member of the Lantern Guild.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - CAPTAINS â Petrel (ship, fishing boat) [ID: 0d21b413-13c7-4726-8b6b-c8f12484a752]: A fishing boat captained by Bren Vale.\n\nNightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: b0cd3a42-d5b0-44dd-972d-da7d960aab40]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a1873c-dda9-7bf5-a8c5-094ae62ee4c8\n  - â CAPTAINS from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 731a80b4-1cd1-40e2-9fe7-618d14dd3932] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Captain of the courier ship Nightjar; she grew up in Vesper and belongs to the Lantern Guild. Her crew usually calls her Captain Ash.\n\nTidal lighthouse of Vesper (lighthouse) [ID: 76dc2022-8211-4657-b177-03c04d118558]: A tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt.\n  - â BUILT_AROUND from Vesper (city, port) [ID: 8e5eb323-f581-4ce1-8cf4-8bceb6847598]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - â MAINTAINS from Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: 8ada2504-3940-4fa0-9142-7b15d6e2c8fa]: The guild that maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners; it does not own the mines.\n  - USES â Blue salt (mineral, fuel) [ID: 8f0beecf-61cb-4419-99eb-e2030a4eafb7]: A salt mined on the island of Orin that powers the lenses of Vesper's tidal lighthouse.\n\nOrin (island) [ID: 9bac8802-f464-491c-b86e-9c90ec862af2]: An island where blue salt is mined.\n  - â MINED_ON from Blue salt (mineral, fuel) [ID: 8f0beecf-61cb-4419-99eb-e2030a4eafb7]: A salt mined on the island of Orin that powers the lenses of Vesper's tidal lighthouse.\n  - â LOCATED_IN from Orin's miners (worker group) [ID: 92474181-bc9f-4dc2-bf64-51e67969f1ea]: Miners on Orin who mine blue salt; the Lantern Guild buys salt from them."}]}}

